== Exhaustion ==
Exhaustion is incurred from doing certain energy-intensive actions, and certain actions exhaust the player more than others. Exhaustion first reduces saturation, and then reduces hunger.

Once the exhaustion level reaches 4.0, it resets to 0.0 and reduces the saturation by {{hunger|1}} if there is any saturation remaining. If the saturation is 0, it reduces the hunger by {{hunger|1}} instead.

